' M5 - SCREEN REOPEN + PALETTE ISOLATION
' No IFF load.
' 1/2: 256-colour reference cycles.
' 3: 16-colour screen + Aga Screen Pattern.
' If 3 hangs, issue is Open/Close/state.
' If 3 opens but pattern colours are wrong, issue is generic 16-colour palette.
' If 3 pattern is correct, issue is inside IFF CMAP application.

Cls
Print "M5 - SCREEN REOPEN + PALETTE"

Print "OPEN 1 - 256"
_A=Aga Screen Open(320,200,256,$00021000)
Amos To Front
Print "RET1 = ";_A
If _A<>0
   Aga Screen Pattern
   Amos To Back
   For _I=1 To 100
      Aga Wait Vbl
   Next _I
   Amos To Front
   Aga Screen Close
   Print "CLOSE1"
End If

Print "OPEN 2 - 256"
_B=Aga Screen Open(320,200,256,$00021000)
Amos To Front
Print "RET2 = ";_B
If _B<>0
   Aga Screen Pattern
   Amos To Back
   For _I=1 To 100
      Aga Wait Vbl
   Next _I
   Amos To Front
   Aga Screen Close
   Print "CLOSE2"
End If

Print "OPEN 3 - 16"
_C=Aga Screen Open(320,256,16,$00021000)
Amos To Front
Print "RET3 = ";_C
If _C<>0
   Aga Screen Pattern
   Amos To Back
   For _I=1 To 200
      Aga Wait Vbl
   Next _I
   Amos To Front
   Aga Screen Close
   Print "CLOSE3"
End If

Wait Key
End
